{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e309d6006945d28042ab","chatId":"6942c9e5cce54c13803d1de036e87a9d","sessionId":null,"userId":61554,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":796,"promptTokens":1543,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:45"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01590639007904019,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e309d6006945d28042aa","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368265041,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e309d6006945d28042aa","chatId":"6942c9e5cce54c13803d1de036e87a9d","sessionId":null,"userId":61554,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n周日上午,小华骑车来到小雷家。小雷正坐在前院车道上研究着几个月前小华送他的生日礼物——一个很酷的遥控汽车。小华高兴地说:\"这辆车你玩得还开心吗?\" 小雷笑着说:\"超级开心,这个遥控功能很好。\"两个小朋友开心地一起把汽车遥控着在车道上转悠着玩耍。小华说:\"我也想试试遥控!\" 他接过遥控器,开了一会儿车后,一个转弯时不小心把车开到草丛里了。小华懊恼地说:\"真对不起,我开歪了。\" 小雷走过去,把汽车从草丛里推出来说:\"没关系,我们可以一起把它修好的,然后继续玩!\"\n\n[问题]\n小华在小雷生日时送了他什么?\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 玩具飞机\nB. 遥控汽车\nC. 玩偶\nD. 火箭模型","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01590639007904019,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e309d6006945d28042ab","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368265038,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"66b69ec9c0604b2b90e359bbee90bb92"}